            "step_id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000940",
            "position": 0,
            "content": "Needs to call off a session.",
            "frame": "https://osybxeojvsqcwxkgnalm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/cell-attachments/cells/a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000170103/d93b0311-6518-cb4f-19df-4f6c3b0f1f88.png",
            "summary": "The tutor can't make a session and opens Toolkit › Your Sessions › Call-Offs to file a call-off, picking a reason: Illness, Family Emergency, Job Conflict, Transportation, Academic Commitment, Signed Up By Mistake, or Other. In spring 2026 this ran at 300–640 call-offs a month; academic commitments and job conflicts were the top reasons.",
            "status": "live",
            "function": null,
            "form": null,
            "owner": null,
