            "position": 0,
            "content": "Tutor supervisor team sends the excuse decision.",
            "frame": null,
            "summary": "The decision — excused or unexcused, with optional notes — posts to the tutor's Call-Offs tab as an unread flag; there's no separate notification channel, so a tutor who doesn't check the tab won't see it.",
