            "position": 0,
            "content": "Assignment algorithm",
            "frame": null,
            "summary": "Automatic tiering: non-lead tutors fill before the lead, each up to baseLoad = floor(students/tutors), then overflow. Within a tier the algorithm prefers lowest current load, then highest prior history with the student (continuity fast-path), then a balanced proficiency mix; emergency round-robin as fallback.",
            "status": "live",
            "function": null,
            "form": null,
            "owner": null,
            "perceived_owner": null,
