            "step_id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000009a07",
            "position": 0,
            "content": "Escalates unresolved issues to tutors@tutors.plus promptly.",
            "frame": "https://osybxeojvsqcwxkgnalm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/cell-attachments/cells/a0000000-0000-4000-8000-0000001a0701/3a876ff6-fdbe-77c5-7a7f-1c7d1c305198.png",
            "summary": "For issues neither the tutors nor the routing channels resolve in-session, teachers escalate by email to tutors@tutors.plus. A dedicated ticketing/servicedesk tool is being selected but is not yet in place.",
